{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13405","headline":"出青门往南山下别业 · 薛据","name":"出青门往南山下别业","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧居在南山，夙驾自城阙。\n榛莽相蔽亏，去尔渐超忽。\n散漫余雪晴，苍茫季冬月。\n寒风吹长林，白日原上没。\n怀抱旷莫伸，相知阻胡越。\n弱年好栖隐，链药在岩窟。\n及此离垢氛，兴来亦因物。\n末路期赤松，斯言庶不伐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛据","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13405.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13405","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}